Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.02,0:00:02.06,EN,,0,0,0,,Novak, you've got quite a history here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.02,0:00:02.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,诺瓦克 你在这一站有不少故事
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.06,0:00:03.18,EN,,0,0,0,,I think if I have it right,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.06,0:00:03.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,如果我没记错
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.18,0:00:05.42,EN,,0,0,0,,this was your first Masters you ever played
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.18,0:00:05.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,这是你打的第一个大师赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.42,0:00:07.10,EN,,0,0,0,,as far as the main draw.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.42,0:00:07.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,至少正赛是
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.10,0:00:09.34,EN,,0,0,0,,And yet the last of the Masters for you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.10,0:00:09.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,而它又是你最后拿下的一个
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.34,0:00:13.66,EN,,0,0,0,,to complete your career Golden Masters.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.34,0:00:13.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,凑齐了生涯金大师
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.66,0:00:15.10,EN,,0,0,0,,You've had quite a journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.66,0:00:15.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,这一路挺不容易
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.10,0:00:16.10,EN,,0,0,0,,Took you a while to get
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.10,0:00:16.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,你花了好一阵
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.10,0:00:17.42,EN,,0,0,0,,over the hump to get the title
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.10,0:00:17.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,才越过那道坎拿到冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.42,0:00:19.02,EN,,0,0,0,,and then finally you found your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.42,0:00:19.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,最后终于找到了办法
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.02,0:00:20.42,EN,,0,0,0,,Just talk about your progression
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.02,0:00:20.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,聊聊你这些年
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.42,0:00:22.30,EN,,0,0,0,,at this particular event over the years
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.42,0:00:22.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,在这一站的变化
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.30,0:00:24.70,EN,,0,0,0,,and what do you remember about that first
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.30,0:00:24.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,第一次来的时候你记得什么
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.70,0:00:26.50,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah, actually thanks for reminding me
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.70,0:00:26.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,对 其实谢谢你提醒我
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.50,0:00:26.86,EN,,0,0,0,,of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.50,0:00:26.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,这件事
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.86,0:00:29.38,EN,,0,0,0,,I I wasn't I wasn't aware that this was the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.86,0:00:29.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,我之前还真不知道 这是
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.38,0:00:34.50,EN,,0,0,0,,first main draw Masters 1000 that I've
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.38,0:00:34.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,我职业生涯打的第一个
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.50,0:00:35.50,EN,,0,0,0,,that I've played in my career.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.50,0:00:35.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,大师赛正赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.50,0:00:39.22,EN,,0,0,0,,So It can be 2005, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.50,0:00:39.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,应该是 2005 年 对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.22,0:00:40.70,EN,,0,0,0,,Five? Was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.22,0:00:40.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,零五年 是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.70,0:00:42.30,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.70,0:00:42.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,对 好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.30,0:00:45.30,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I I do remember now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.30,0:00:45.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,我现在想起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.30,0:00:49.98,EN,,0,0,0,,I played on court one at the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.30,0:00:49.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,当时我是在一号场打的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.98,0:00:51.82,EN,,0,0,0,,So grandstand actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.98,0:00:51.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,其实就是看台球场
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.82,0:00:55.90,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's been it's been now what 20 21
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.82,0:00:55.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,到现在已经二十
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.90,0:00:57.58,EN,,0,0,0,,years coming back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.90,0:00:57.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,二十一年了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.58,0:00:58.10,EN,,0,0,0,,You know,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.58,0:00:58.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,你知道
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.10,0:01:01.42,EN,,0,0,0,,the last time I was here I won the title in 23.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.10,0:01:01.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,上一次来是二三年 我拿了冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.42,0:01:04.14,EN,,0,0,0,,Had that one of the most epic, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.42,0:01:04.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,那是最史诗的一场
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.14,0:01:06.82,EN,,0,0,0,,best of three matches that that I was I
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.14,0:01:06.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,三盘两胜的比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.82,0:01:09.46,EN,,0,0,0,,was ever part of and you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.82,0:01:09.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,我打过的里面数一数二
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.46,0:01:10.54,EN,,0,0,0,,great memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.46,0:01:10.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,回忆特别好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.54,0:01:12.90,EN,,0,0,0,,It took me a while to to win
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.54,0:01:12.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,我花了好一阵
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.90,0:01:13.78,EN,,0,0,0,,my first title here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.90,0:01:13.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,才拿到这里的第一个冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.78,0:01:15.86,EN,,0,0,0,,I think I lost four or five finals prior
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.78,0:01:15.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,在那之前我输了四五个决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.86,0:01:17.34,EN,,0,0,0,,to to winning it for the first time
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.86,0:01:17.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,才第一次赢下来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.34,0:01:18.86,EN,,0,0,0,,against Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.34,0:01:18.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,对手是费德勒
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.86,0:01:21.70,EN,,0,0,0,,Actually was losing mostly to him
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.86,0:01:21.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,之前那几个决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.70,0:01:23.38,EN,,0,0,0,,in those finals that I played previously
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.70,0:01:23.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,我基本上都是输给他
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.38,0:01:28.66,EN,,0,0,0,,and yeah, it was a hard hurdle
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.38,0:01:28.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,对我来说那是一道
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.66,0:01:30.26,EN,,0,0,0,,for me to overcome really.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.66,0:01:30.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,很难迈过去的坎
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.26,0:01:32.50,EN,,0,0,0,,But once I I got the first title it
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.26,0:01:32.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,但第一个冠军一到手
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.50,0:01:35.66,EN,,0,0,0,,was it kind of felt
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.50,0:01:35.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,那种感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.66,0:01:37.86,EN,,0,0,0,,as a huge relief in in a in a sense,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.66,0:01:37.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,某种意义上是巨大的释然
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.86,0:01:38.82,EN,,0,0,0,,you know, coming back knowing
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.86,0:01:38.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,你知道 再回来的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.82,0:01:39.90,EN,,0,0,0,,that you won at least once.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.82,0:01:39.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,至少知道自己赢过一次
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.90,0:01:44.94,EN,,0,0,0,,So I've had some great support here
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.90,0:01:44.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,我在这里得到过很多支持
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.94,0:01:49.58,EN,,0,0,0,,from Illinois and Chicago, Ohio,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.94,0:01:49.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,来自伊利诺伊 芝加哥 俄亥俄
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.58,0:01:52.34,EN,,0,0,0,,Serbian community that is pretty big.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.58,0:01:52.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,这边的塞尔维亚人不少
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.34,0:01:53.94,EN,,0,0,0,,That's what I remember actually
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.34,0:01:53.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,这也是我印象最深的一点
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.94,0:01:58.46,EN,,0,0,0,,from the 23 finals and 2018 finals.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.94,0:01:58.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,二三年和一八年那两个决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.46,0:01:59.42,EN,,0,0,0,,Quite a lot of, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.46,0:01:59.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,看台上
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.42,0:02:01.98,EN,,0,0,0,,Serbian flags on the stadium.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.42,0:02:01.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,有好多塞尔维亚国旗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.98,0:02:04.46,EN,,0,0,0,,That was that was really nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.98,0:02:04.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,那真的很棒
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.46,0:02:08.14,EN,,0,0,0,,And I and I look forward playing
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.46,0:02:08.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,我也很期待
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.14,0:02:09.38,EN,,0,0,0,,this tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.14,0:02:09.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,打这一站
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.38,0:02:12.06,EN,,0,0,0,,As I said that I played last and won in 23
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.38,0:02:12.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,刚说了 我上次打是二三年
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.06,0:02:15.18,EN,,0,0,0,,and facilities have improved
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.06,0:02:15.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,而这里的设施
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.18,0:02:16.74,EN,,0,0,0,,so much tremendously.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.18,0:02:16.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,进步得太多了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.74,0:02:19.30,EN,,0,0,0,,Incredible job Ben Navarro
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.74,0:02:19.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,本·纳瓦罗和整个团队
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.30,0:02:21.50,EN,,0,0,0,,and the rest of the team has done.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.30,0:02:21.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,干得非常漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.50,0:02:23.26,EN,,0,0,0,,Kudos to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.50,0:02:23.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,该给他们点赞
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.26,0:02:26.98,EN,,0,0,0,,You know, it's it's a it's a huge change.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.26,0:02:26.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,变化真的太大了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.98,0:02:29.22,EN,,0,0,0,,I think it has become one
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.98,0:02:29.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得对大多数球员来说
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.22,0:02:32.06,EN,,0,0,0,,of the the favorite Masters events
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.22,0:02:32.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,这儿已经成了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.06,0:02:33.46,EN,,0,0,0,,for for most of the players,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.06,0:02:33.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,最喜欢的大师赛之一
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.46,0:02:34.74,EN,,0,0,0,,which is which is very nice to see
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.46,0:02:34.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,看到这个我很高兴
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.74,0:02:36.38,EN,,0,0,0,,and I see why.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.74,0:02:36.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,也明白为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.38,0:02:38.58,EN,,0,0,0,,And and you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.38,0:02:38.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,另外
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.58,0:02:40.02,EN,,0,0,0,,as far as my preparation goes
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.58,0:02:40.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,从我为美网做的准备来说
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.02,0:02:42.90,EN,,0,0,0,,for New York is is this is great, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.02,0:02:42.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,这一站太合适了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.90,0:02:45.86,EN,,0,0,0,,me being able to participate at least
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.90,0:02:45.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,至少能让我打上
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.86,0:02:47.10,EN,,0,0,0,,in one tournament, you know, a you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.86,0:02:47.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,一站比赛 而且是
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.10,0:02:48.66,EN,,0,0,0,,strong tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.10,0:02:48.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,分量足的一站
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.66,0:02:51.06,EN,,0,0,0,,Play one or more matches,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.66,0:02:51.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,打上一场或者更多
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.06,0:02:53.38,EN,,0,0,0,,hopefully more than one.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.06,0:02:53.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,希望不止一场
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.38,0:02:55.42,EN,,0,0,0,,And, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.38,0:02:55.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,然后
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.42,0:02:59.10,EN,,0,0,0,,get get myself ready for for New York.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.42,0:02:59.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,把自己调整到能去纽约的状态
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.10,0:03:01.14,EN,,0,0,0,,I know I'm just curious what it's like
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.10,0:03:01.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,我很好奇 当纪录片的主角
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.14,0:03:02.54,EN,,0,0,0,,being a documentary star.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.14,0:03:02.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,是什么感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.54,0:03:04.22,EN,,0,0,0,,As someone who obviously
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.54,0:03:04.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,你出门在外
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.22,0:03:05.34,EN,,0,0,0,,when you go out in public there are a lot
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.22,0:03:05.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,本来就有一大堆镜头
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.34,0:03:06.02,EN,,0,0,0,,of cameras on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.34,0:03:06.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,对着你
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.02,0:03:07.50,EN,,0,0,0,,What is it like having them
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.02,0:03:07.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,那把镜头带进
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.50,0:03:09.34,EN,,0,0,0,,in your more personal spaces?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.50,0:03:09.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,更私人的空间里呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.34,0:03:11.06,EN,,0,0,0,,Well, it's been a long project,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.34,0:03:11.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,这个项目做了很久
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.06,0:03:14.58,EN,,0,0,0,,you know, started in 2017 actually
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.06,0:03:14.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,其实二〇一七年就开始了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.58,0:03:19.70,EN,,0,0,0,,and changed many directors and a little bit
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.58,0:03:19.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,换过好几个导演 中间
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.70,0:03:22.82,EN,,0,0,0,,of a break in Corona a few years.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.70,0:03:22.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,还因为疫情停了几年
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.82,0:03:27.74,EN,,0,0,0,,Change of you know, cuts and versions
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.82,0:03:27.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,剪辑版本、概念
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.74,0:03:29.70,EN,,0,0,0,,and concepts and etc.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.74,0:03:29.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,也都改过
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.70,0:03:32.30,EN,,0,0,0,,and, you know, I'm biased
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.70,0:03:32.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,我承认我有偏心
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.30,0:03:34.74,EN,,0,0,0,,and I I I'm quite subjective.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.30,0:03:34.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,我很主观
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.74,0:03:36.82,EN,,0,0,0,,So, it's kind of hard for me to be neutral
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.74,0:03:36.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以我很难保持中立
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.82,0:03:39.90,EN,,0,0,0,,and objectively you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.82,0:03:39.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,也很难客观
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.90,0:03:43.34,EN,,0,0,0,,give you feedback and talk about you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.90,0:03:43.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,给你什么评价 去谈
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.34,0:03:45.38,EN,,0,0,0,,what I think of the documentary.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.34,0:03:45.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,我对这部片子怎么看
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.38,0:03:48.02,EN,,0,0,0,,Obviously, being very involved in it,
