Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.38,0:07:57.26,EN,,0,0,0,,professional athlete.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.38,0:07:57.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,尤其是个人项目
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.26,0:07:58.94,EN,,0,0,0,,And it's what most of the athletes
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.26,0:07:58.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,大多数运动员
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.94,0:08:01.02,EN,,0,0,0,,are doing, the younger ones today.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.94,0:08:01.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,都是这么做的 年轻人也一样
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.02,0:08:02.50,EN,,0,0,0,,And that's what I've done,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.02,0:08:02.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,我也一直这么做
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.50,0:08:03.98,EN,,0,0,0,,but you know, things change
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.50,0:08:03.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,但情况在变
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.98,0:08:09.90,EN,,0,0,0,,and and I I don't want to have that kind
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.98,0:08:09.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,而我不想让自己
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.90,0:08:11.70,EN,,0,0,0,,of one-dimensional feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.90,0:08:11.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,只剩下一个维度
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.70,0:08:12.54,EN,,0,0,0,,Is there a moment
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.70,0:08:12.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,有没有那么一个时刻
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.54,0:08:14.94,EN,,0,0,0,,though like like 10 days ago, 2 weeks ago
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.54,0:08:14.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,比如十天前、两周前
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.94,0:08:16.98,EN,,0,0,0,,where you said, "Okay, now I'm going
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.94,0:08:16.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,你说 好 从现在起
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.98,0:08:19.02,EN,,0,0,0,,to start getting serious again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.98,0:08:19.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,该重新认真起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.02,0:08:21.70,EN,,0,0,0,,Again, I need this many hours in the gym,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.02,0:08:21.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,健身房要练够多少小时
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.70,0:08:23.70,EN,,0,0,0,,this too much time on the tennis court."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.70,0:08:23.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,球场上要花多少时间
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.70,0:08:25.06,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah, obviously there's always
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.70,0:08:25.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,有的 一直都有
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.06,0:08:26.22,EN,,0,0,0,,a constant communication
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.06,0:08:26.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,持续的沟通
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.22,0:08:27.26,EN,,0,0,0,,with my professional team.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.22,0:08:27.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,跟我的专业团队
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.26,0:08:29.34,EN,,0,0,0,,So, we do have you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.26,0:08:29.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以我们
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.34,0:08:30.18,EN,,0,0,0,,we do plan ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.34,0:08:30.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,确实会提前规划
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.18,0:08:32.58,EN,,0,0,0,,It's not like, you know, "Hey guys,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.18,0:08:32.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,不是那种 嘿 各位
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.58,0:08:34.38,EN,,0,0,0,,I actually want to play tennis tomorrow,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.58,0:08:34.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,我明天想打球了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.38,0:08:35.38,EN,,0,0,0,,so can you come?" You know,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.38,0:08:35.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,你们能来吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.38,0:08:38.02,EN,,0,0,0,,it's not really you know, out of the blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.38,0:08:38.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,不是临时起意
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.02,0:08:40.78,EN,,0,0,0,,It's It's planning and scheduling
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.02,0:08:40.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,是规划、是排期
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.78,0:08:42.94,EN,,0,0,0,,and calendar and it's you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.78,0:08:42.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,是日历上的事
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.94,0:08:44.82,EN,,0,0,0,,it's been like that all my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.94,0:08:44.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,我这辈子一直是这么过的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.82,0:08:46.10,EN,,0,0,0,,And there's one thing
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.82,0:08:46.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,网球运动员这行
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.10,0:08:47.02,EN,,0,0,0,,about tennis players,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.10,0:08:47.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,有一点很确定
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.02,0:08:49.02,EN,,0,0,0,,you learn to plan ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.02,0:08:49.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,你会学着提前安排
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.02,0:08:51.74,EN,,0,0,0,,I don't maybe plan as far as ahead ahead
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.02,0:08:51.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,我现在可能没有排得那么远
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.74,0:08:53.10,EN,,0,0,0,,as I've done most of my career.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.74,0:08:53.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,不像生涯大部分时候
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.10,0:08:53.94,EN,,0,0,0,,In the last couple years,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.10,0:08:53.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,这两年
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.94,0:08:57.82,EN,,0,0,0,,it's kind of a little bit less ahead, but still,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.94,0:08:57.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,排得近了一点 但还是
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.82,0:09:00.90,EN,,0,0,0,,you know, understanding of, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.82,0:09:00.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,得清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.90,0:09:02.78,EN,,0,0,0,,where I am with the state of my body
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.90,0:09:02.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,自己身体处在什么状态
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.78,0:09:05.34,EN,,0,0,0,,and how much I really need to, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.78,0:09:05.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,以及我真正需要多少
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.34,0:09:06.74,EN,,0,0,0,,have you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.34,0:09:06.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,多少时间
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.74,0:09:09.62,EN,,0,0,0,,work with my physiotherapist hands-on,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.74,0:09:09.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,跟理疗师一对一地做
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.62,0:09:12.26,EN,,0,0,0,,prepare my body, start, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.62,0:09:12.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,把身体准备好 然后开始
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.26,0:09:14.62,EN,,0,0,0,,with more serious training,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.26,0:09:14.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,更认真的训练
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.62,0:09:16.30,EN,,0,0,0,,more structured training,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.62,0:09:16.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,更有结构的训练
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.30,0:09:20.78,EN,,0,0,0,,but not the the physical activity
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.30,0:09:20.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,但身体活动这件事
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.78,0:09:21.90,EN,,0,0,0,,for me never stops.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.78,0:09:21.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,对我来说从来不停
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.90,0:09:22.82,EN,,0,0,0,,Even when I'm resting,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.90,0:09:22.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,就算在休息
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.82,0:09:23.98,EN,,0,0,0,,I'm doing something.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.82,0:09:23.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,我也在做点什么
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.98,0:09:25.98,EN,,0,0,0,,So, it's it's it's my lifestyle.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.98,0:09:25.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,这就是我的生活方式
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.98,0:09:27.26,EN,,0,0,0,,It's my choice. It's what I love
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.98,0:09:27.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,是我的选择 也是我热爱的事
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.26,0:09:30.78,EN,,0,0,0,,to do to stay healthy for my longevity,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.26,0:09:30.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,为了健康 为了长久
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.78,0:09:31.70,EN,,0,0,0,,for everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.78,0:09:31.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,为了一切
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.70,0:09:32.22,EN,,0,0,0,,You know, I don't
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.70,0:09:32.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,你知道 我不
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.22,0:09:33.06,EN,,0,0,0,,Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.22,0:09:33.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.06,0:09:35.34,EN,,0,0,0,,I I you know, I play tennis even
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.06,0:09:35.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,我就算在休息
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.34,0:09:37.82,EN,,0,0,0,,when I'm resting. I play tennis
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.34,0:09:37.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,也照样打球
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.82,0:09:39.46,EN,,0,0,0,,with my wife, with my son,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.82,0:09:39.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,跟太太打 跟儿子打
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.46,0:09:40.18,EN,,0,0,0,,with my daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.46,0:09:40.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,跟女儿打
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.18,0:09:41.90,EN,,0,0,0,,I play with my brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.18,0:09:41.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,也跟我兄弟们打
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.90,0:09:43.26,EN,,0,0,0,,We have fun, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.90,0:09:43.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们玩得很开心
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.26,0:09:45.72,EN,,0,0,0,,Just trying to enjoy life.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.26,0:09:45.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,就是想好好享受生活
